  "$scenarioSets_note": "A scenario set is ONE surface depicted under many inputs. The signing sheet is the app's clearest case: SigningRequestModal hosts a single SigningSheet, and the 25 boards are request KINDS of it, not 25 destinations. Wiring 24 fake edges between them would misdescribe the product; declaring the set says what is true \u2014 reach the surface once, and every scenario is a rendering of it. The graph audit counts set members as reached when the canonical board is.",
